<p>Dark Rum is one of the official grades of rum, that typically comes in brown, black, or red colours.</p>
<p>Dark Rums are typically made using caramelised sugar or molasses, aged longer than other rums in charred barrels, and usually have much stronger flavours than light or golden rums.</p>
